# Many bonds: the "Bonds you owe" list gets a vertical scrollbar and scrolls to the last row; the
# footer stays below the list. Sells five ₡1,000 1-year bonds through the section and repays them
# in cleanup (a few cents of interest at most). Never touches the player's own bonds.
name City bonds: many owed bonds show a scrollbar and scroll to the last row
show-economy loans
bonds-section show
bonds-term 1
bonds-amount 1,000
click FinanceOverhaulBondsSell
wait 0.4
click FinanceOverhaulBondsSell
wait 0.4
click FinanceOverhaulBondsSell
wait 0.4
click FinanceOverhaulBondsSell
wait 0.4
click FinanceOverhaulBondsSell
wait 0.8
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulBondsOwedScrollbar
expect-no-overlap FinanceOverhaulBondsOwedList FinanceOverhaulBondsFooter
scroll-bottom FinanceOverhaulBondsOwedList
expect-in-view FinanceOverhaulBondsRow-$bond FinanceOverhaulBondsOwedList
capture bonds-scrolled
cleanup:
redeem-new-bonds
bonds-section auto
close-economy
